OL,3,GNEWSANurses vote for industrial action
OL,4,Aover pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FNurses in Northern Ireland have voted
OL,7,Foverwhelmingly to take industrial
OL,8,Faction, including strike action, over
OL,9,Fpay.
OL,11,FThey will take continuous action short
OL,12,Fof strike from 3 December, with a date
OL,13,Ffor full strike action to be confirmed.
OL,14,FAction short of a strike includes
OL,15,Fworking to rule and a ban on overtime.
OL,17,FThe Royal College of Nursing (RCN) said
OL,18,Fthe action was the result of the
OL,19,Ffailure of the Northern Ireland
OL,20,FExecutive and Department of Health to
OL,21,Fimplement the 2026-27 pay award.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
